            <title>[LU-2661] Failure on test suite parallel-scale-nfsv3 test_compilebench: compilebench failed: 1</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-2661</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for sarah &amp;lt;sarah@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://maloo.whamcloud.com/test_sets/02b35f76-62c9-11e2-982f-52540035b04c" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://maloo.whamcloud.com/test_sets/02b35f76-62c9-11e2-982f-52540035b04c&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_compilebench failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;compilebench failed: 1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test log shows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;== parallel-scale-nfsv3 test compilebench: compilebench == 17:43:20 (1358646200)
OPTIONS:
cbench_DIR=/usr/bin
cbench_IDIRS=2
cbench_RUNS=2
client-22-ib
client-23-ib.lab.whamcloud.com
./compilebench -D /mnt/lustre/d0.compilebench -i 2         -r 2 --makej
using working directory /mnt/lustre/d0.compilebench, 2 intial dirs 2 runs
native unpatched native-0 222MB in 175.01 seconds (1.27 MB/s)
native patched native-0 109MB in 45.93 seconds (2.39 MB/s)
Traceback (most recent call last):
  File "./compilebench", line 567, in &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;
    dset = dataset(options.sources, rnd)
  File "./compilebench", line 322, in __init__
    self.compiled = native_order(self.compiled, "patched compiled")
  File "./compilebench", line 97, in native_order
    run_directory(tmplist, dirname, "native %s" % tag)
  File "./compilebench", line 245, in run_directory
    fp.close()
IOError: [Errno 5] Input/output error
 parallel-scale-nfsv3 test_compilebench: @@@@@@ FAIL: compilebench failed: 1 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mds dmesg:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: == parallel-scale-nfsv3 test compilebench: compilebench == 17:43:20 (1358646200)
Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: /usr/sbin/lctl mark .\/compilebench -D \/mnt\/lustre\/d0.compilebench -i 2         -r 2 --makej
Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: ./compilebench -D /mnt/lustre/d0.compilebench -i 2 -r 2 --makej
nfsd: non-standard errno: -9
Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: /usr/sbin/lctl mark  parallel-scale-nfsv3 test_compilebench: @@@@@@ FAIL: compilebench failed: 1 
Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: parallel-scale-nfsv3 test_compilebench: @@@@@@ FAIL: compilebench failed: 1
Lustre: DEBUG MARKER: /usr/sbin/lctl dk &amp;gt; /logdir/test_logs/2013-01-19/lustre-master-el6-x86_64--full--1_1_1__1176__-70295712534640-000009/parallel-scale-nfsv3.test_compilebench.debug_log.$(hostname -s).1358646497.log;
         dmesg &amp;gt; /logdir/test_logs/2013-01-19/lustre-maste
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
